    "content": "The Developer Guide is for plugin authors and platform contributors. It covers the plugin architecture, the contracts each plugin type implements, and the tooling that ships with the monorepo.\n\nIf you are operating Checkstack rather than extending it, the [User Guide](/checkstack/user-guide/) is the right starting point.",
