      "Retention Job",
      "Stage 1: Raw → Hourly",
      "Stage 2: Hourly → Daily",
      "Stage 3: Expired Cleanup",
      "Stage 4: State-transition prune",
      "Aggregate state transitions",
      "Health-state provider",
      "Configurable Retention",
      "RPC Endpoints",
      "On-the-Fly Aggregation",
